sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Account Servicer
    participant O as Account Owner
    Note left of S: Preliminary announcement
    S->>O: CorporateActionNotification (NEWM)
    Note left of S: Confirmed announcement
    S->>O: CorporateActionNotification (REPL)
    S->>O: CorporateActionNotification (REPL + Event stage)
    Note left of S: Entitlement
    S->>O: CorporateActionNotification (REPL + Eligible balance)
    Note left of S: Final entitlement (eg. Mandatory events)
    S->>O: CorporateActionMovementPreliminaryAdvice (NEWM)
    S->>O: CorporateActionEventProcessingStatusAdvice (Status pending)
